  <h2>Trusted Legal Representation in Wicomico County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Wicomico County is the commercial and cultural hub of Maryland's Lower Eastern Shore, 
    with Salisbury serving as the region's largest city. Home to Salisbury University and 
    TidalHealth Peninsula Regional hospital, the county sees significant traffic and economic 
    activity. Attorney Alex Poberesky provides experienced legal representation to Wicomico 
    County residents facing personal injury claims and criminal charges.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Wicomico County</h3>
  
  <p>
    As the Lower Shore's commercial center, Salisbury and surrounding areas see heavy traffic 
    on Routes 50, 13, and 13 Business. Truck traffic serving the Delmarva Peninsula adds to 
    accident risks. Whether you've been hurt in a collision, injured at work, or suffered 
    harm due to negligence, we can help.
  </p>
  
  <p>Our Wicomico County personal injury practice includes:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car and truck accidents on Routes 50 and 13</li>
    <li>Accidents involving poultry industry trucks</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries at processing plants and distribution facilities</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at TidalHealth Peninsula Regional</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents</li>
    <li>Bicycle and pedestrian accidents</li>
    <li>Construction accidents</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Wicomico County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Criminal charges in Wicomico County require experienced defense. Whether you're facing 
    DUI charges, drug offenses, assault, theft, or other criminal matters, we provide 
    aggressive representation to protect your rights and future.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving the Lower Eastern Shore</h3>
  
  <p>
    Our firm brings over 26 years of legal experience to Wicomico County clients. While our 
    office is in Pikesville, we regularly travel to Salisbury to meet with clients and appear 
    in court. We understand the local community and the importance of effective representation.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Wicomico County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Wicomico County, including Salisbury, Fruitland, Delmar, 
